==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Sandshrew}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Alolan Sandshrew|137}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*{{m|Scratch}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Sandshrew can learn.
